flowchart TB
  SDJ[Spring Data JPA]
  SDJ --> REPO[Repository Hierarchy]
  REPO --> CR[CrudRepository]
  REPO --> PR[PagingAndSortingRepository]
  REPO --> JR[JpaRepository]
  REPO --> QDM[QueryDerivation]

  SDJ --> QUERY[Query Methods]
  QUERY --> DQ[Derived Queries]
  DQ --> FIND[findBy]
  DQ --> COUNT[countBy]
  DQ --> EXISTS[existsBy]
  DQ --> DELETE[deleteBy]
  QUERY --> JPQL[JPQL with Query]
  QUERY --> NATIVE[Native Queries]
  QUERY --> MODIFY[Modifying]

  SDJ --> SPEC[Specifications]
  SPEC --> CRIT[Criteria API]
  CRIT --> CB[CriteriaBuilder]
  CRIT --> CQ[CriteriaQuery]
  CRIT --> PRED[Predicate]

  SDJ --> QDSL[QueryDSL]
  QDSL --> QGEN[Q-Type Generation]
  QDSL --> FQ[Fluent Queries]

  SDJ --> PAGIN[Pagination Sorting]
  PAGIN --> PAGE[Pageable / Page]
  PAGIN --> SORT[Sort]
  PAGIN --> KSP[Keyset Pagination]

  SDJ --> PROJ[Projections]
  PROJ --> CI[Closed Interface]
  PROJ --> OI[Open Interface]
  PROJ --> DTO[DTO Projections]

  SDJ --> AUDIT[Auditing]
  AUDIT --> CD[CreatedDate / ModifiedDate]
  AUDIT --> CBY[CreatedBy / ModifiedBy]

  SDJ --> CUST[Custom Repositories]
  CUST --> IMPL[Impl Pattern]
  CUST --> MIX[Mixin Fragments]
